{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02586","headline":"赋得慎罚 · 虞世南","name":"赋得慎罚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝图光往册，上德表鸿名。\n道冠二仪始，风高三代英。\n乐和知化洽，讼息表刑清。\n罚轻犹在念，忽喜尚留情。\n明慎全无枉，哀矜在好生。\n五疵过亦察，二辟理弥精。\n幪巾示廉耻，嘉石务详平。\n每削繁苛性，常深恻隐诚。\n政宽思济猛，疑罪必从轻。\n于张惩不滥，陈郭宪无倾。\n刑措谅斯在，欢然仰颂声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"虞世南","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}